Wine gdiplus: BeginContainer starts a nested container, with a world transform relative to the outer one and a clip inside the outer clip, as Windows does. Fixes the FSLabs PFD attitude sky and ground cut by a tilted edge in turns.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

